<title>MALAYSIA: Multi-Purpose stock suspended.</title>
<headline>Multi-Purpose stock suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Multi-Purpose Holdings Bhd were suspended on Friday at the company's request, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Officials at the company were not available for comment. Multi-Purpose's businesses include shipping, financial services and gaming.</p>
<p>Its shares closed at 4.90 ringgit on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
